{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWhat\u2019s it like to leave your exams behind and head home? But what if \u2018home\u2019 holds more than just the path back?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846920/extras/5436fff5551926f9e317d1a4661970cb.poster.avif?t=1773135012\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846920/extras/5436fff5551926f9e317d1a4661970cb.webm?t=1773135012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a worrying phone call, you rush to board the train\u2014only to find that instead of the usual peaceful journey, subtle hints point to something hidden. <strong>Anomaly Express</strong> is a first\u2011person adventure game in which you\u2019ll explore silent compartments and moonlit corridors of a night train to uncover why you\u2019ve been drawn into this mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you\u2019ll encounter:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single\u2011player mode and co\u2011op</strong> for up to 4 players</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric locales</strong>, from the snug kitchen\u2011berth to the abandoned sleeper car;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classical compositions</strong> immersing you in the cozy train\u2011compartment atmosphere;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A gripping story</strong> you can dive into solo or share with friends;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four close friends</strong>, each with a unique personality yet bound by unbreakable bonds;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A charming visual style</strong> that invites you deeper into the mystery.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3846920?t=1773135012","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846920/93f8ae198b26a9d687c0c6e5fb987f0981cf4e06/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773135012","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846920/70290e2d629fe5cca8c2906449b9a666df076c52/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773135012","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846920/70290e2d629fe5cca8c2906449b9a666df076c52/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773135012","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWhat\u2019s it like to leave your exams behind and head home? But what if \u2018home\u2019 holds more than just the path back?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846920/extras/5436fff5551926f9e317d1a4661970cb.poster.avif?t=1773135012\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846920/extras/5436fff5551926f9e317d1a4661970cb.webm?t=1773135012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a worrying phone call, you rush to board the train\u2014only to find that instead of the usual peaceful journey, subtle hints point to something hidden. <strong>Anomaly Express</strong> is a first\u2011person adventure game in which you\u2019ll explore silent compartments and moonlit corridors of a night train to uncover why you\u2019ve been drawn into this mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you\u2019ll encounter:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single\u2011player mode and co\u2011op</strong> for up to 4 players</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric locales</strong>, from the snug kitchen\u2011berth to the abandoned sleeper car;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classical compositions</strong> immersing you in the cozy train\u2011compartment atmosphere;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A gripping story</strong> you can dive into solo or share with friends;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four close friends</strong>, each with a unique personality yet bound by unbreakable bonds;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A charming visual style</strong> that invites you deeper into the mystery.</p></li></ul>","developers":["NAC Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846920/1230b297555cc242416df7dfa849b45dba7ca397/header.jpg?t=1773135012","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3846920/930260428/c0170804ae98ec2e57c3ae90af5d3e13170148a0/1756225254/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756227576","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3846920/930260428/c0170804ae98ec2e57c3ae90af5d3e13170148a0/1756225254/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756227576","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3846920/930260428/c0170804ae98ec2e57c3ae90af5d3e13170148a0/1756225254/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756227576","id":257189222,"name":"Teaser Trailer Anomaly Express","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257189222/9f7279c6e6cd643feaaf5b2a0292600b17bdf668/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756227576"}],"name":"Anomaly Express","package_